==Trivia==
*Sprout's [[Toon Handler]] is {{CI|Sam Mclaughlin|name=true}}. 
**Sprout's Toon Handler is confirmed by [[Qwelver]] to be non-binary. He is the only {{Type|Main}} to not share the same gender as his Toon Handler.
*Sprout is {{CI|Cosmo|name=true}}'s best friend, as confirmed in various dialogues with Sprout mentioning Cosmo.
**They have matching bracelets for [[Trinkets]], those being {{TI|Sweet Charm|name=true}} and {{TI|Savory Charm|name=true}}.
**They have many matching [[Skins]], such as {{Skin|Caramel Drizzle Cosmo}} & {{Skin|Salted Caramel Sprout}} and {{Skin|Berry Roll Cosmo}} & {{Skin|ChocoBerry Sprout}}.
**Cosmo and Sprout's corresponding [[Twisteds]] also have similar [[Ichor]] patterns; Cosmo only has Ichor on his right arm and eye, while Sprout has Ichor everywhere except his right arm and eye.
**Their [[Abilities]] heal a [[Toon]] by 1{{Heart}}.
**They share similar hobbies: baking/cooking.
**Additionally, both of them are based of foods and are the second Toons to be so, with the first being {{CI|Shrimpo|name=true}}, the third being {{CI|Ginger|name=true}}, the fourth being {{CI|Eggson|name=true}} and {{CI|Cocoa|name=true}}, and the fifth being {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}}.
**They were optimized on the same [[Update]].
***Sprout and [[Cosmo]] are the first [[Toons]] that were not released in [[Changelog|v0.1]] to receive an optimized model.
****Additionally, Sprout is the third base game [[Main Character]] Toon to receive an optimized model, with the first being {{CI|Pebble|name=true}}, the second being {{CI|Vee|name=true}}, and the fourth being {{CI|Astro|name=true}} and {{CI|Shelly|name=true}}.
*****Sprout is the first non-Release Main Character to get optimized.
****Sprout is the fifth Main Character Toon (in general) to have an optimized model.
**{{CI|Twisted Sprout|name=true}} can be heard saying Cosmo's name when he sees a player or loses interest. He also occasionally follows {{CI|Twisted Cosmo|name=true}} if he is on the current floor.
*According to one of the lore videos in [[Sprout's Floor]], Sprout had an idea and knew what [[Cosmo]]'s appearance and personality was, but Cosmo wasn't created or made at that time, which caused Sprout to beg for [[Delilah]] to make Cosmo real.
*Sprout's experiment name is M-003, with the '''M''' standing most likely for {{Type|Main}}.
*Sprout is the last base-game [[Main Character]] to be released.
*Sprout is said to be overprotective with his friends, made obvious by his Passive [[Ability]] and his interactions with other [[Toons]].
*Sprout's full name was announced in the Halloween 2024 stream, which is '''Sprout Seedly'''.
**Sprout is shameful of his last name, as said by [[Qwelver]] in the same stream<ref>https://www.youtube.com/live/XaSI55o0P5o?t=4329</ref>. This is further proven in his interaction with {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}}, where the former suggests the latter call him by his first name due to his disliking of it.
*If there is more than one Sprout in a round, the price for Sprout's {{AI|Sprout|name=true}} [[Ability]] increases by 50 {{Tape|name=true}} and the cooldown increases by 30 seconds per Sprout.
**This means that, in a game with 7 other Sprouts, '''Baked Sweets''' will cost 450 Tapes and its cooldown will be 310 seconds.
**On release, however, Sprout's cooldown and Tape count didn't increase depending on how many other Sprouts were present.
**The same happens to [[Ginger]]'s {{AI|Ginger}}'''Baked with Care!''' Ability.
*Prior to his optimization, Sprout's cupcakes matched his [[Skins]]' color scheme, with the wrapper alike his scarf's design, the frosting matching his limbs' color, and the sprinkles colored like his head and torso.
**His [[Star-Time]] Skin was the only skin that changed the cupcake, albeit not in the same way as the other skins, with the frosting colored cyan and the sprinkles colored yellow, instead of a cyan-white gradient, although the wrapper had his scarf's design.
*Sprout seems to tend to forget to turn off the oven when he bakes, based on one of his dialogues when descending the [[Elevator]] and the TV animation of him and [[Cosmo]] baking.
**This is also shown in a sketch by [[Qwelver]], showing Cosmo, Sprout and their [[Twisted]] counterparts.
*Sprout, alongside {{CI|Scraps|name=true}}, {{CI|Bobette|name=true}}, and {{CI|Blot|name=true}} have the greatest Stamina value—200 Stamina units.
*Sprout is one of the [[Toons]] that has an official [[Merchandise]] plush as of now, with the others being [[Astro]], {{CI|Boxten|name=true}}, {{CI|Dandy|name=true}}, {{CI|Poppy|name=true}}, [[Pebble]], [[Shelly]], [[Vee]], [[Gourdy]], {{CI|Bassie|name=true}}, [[Cocoa]], {{CI|Dyle|name=true}}, {{CI|Goob|name=true}}, and [[Cosmo]].
