**They are both male.
**They share almost the same [[Stats]], with Blot only having one less {{Star}} on Skill Check.
***They consequently both have 5 Stars in Stamina (200 stamina).
**Both their Active [[Abilities]] cost [[Tapes]], can help someone (Sprout's heals and Blot's attracts [[Twisteds]]), and have 3D models for them (Sprout's cupcake and Blot's {{CI|Blot Jr.|name=true}}).
**Both their Twisted counterparts summon black traps that, if approached, could damage you.
***However, [[Twisted Sprout]] isn't stationary while {{CI|Twisted Blot|name=true}} is.
***Additionally, both them and their Twisted counterparts appear in separate thumbnails.
**They both have 2 interactions with [[Astro]], [[Cosmo]], {{CI|Glisten|name=true}}, [[Shelly]], and [[Vee]].
**For all of their similarities, Sprout is the first, with the second being Blot.
*Sprout and [[Teagan]] were tied for having the most expensive [[Ability]], until Teagan's Ability was reduced to 75 [[Tapes]], making Sprout have the most expensive Ability.
**This may have happened as healing for the team is much more important than self-healing and therefore should be costlier.
**With [[Ginger]]'s Ability rework, she ties with Sprout.
*Sprout is the second [[Toon]], alongside [[Pebble]], to have both themselves and their {{CI|Twisted Sprout}}[[Twisted Sprout|Twisted counterpart]] be in a thumbnail, being the [[Changelog|v0.4.0]] and v0.14 thumbnails.
